{
  "_readme": "Lab lesson formats (syllabus fix, Phase 7C). Each archetype is an ordered list of sections. 'kind' says how a section is written and drawn (see src/lib/labs/sections.ts for the kinds); 'title' is what students see; 'optional' lets the AI leave it out (null) when the experiment has none; 'diagram' links procedure steps to the setup diagram or circuit they highlight. Classification: a lab's NAME is matched against 'courseKeywords' in the order the archetypes are listed (first match wins); with no match, its experiment names are scored; then 'branchDefaults'. 'switch' moves single experiments of a mixed lab to another archetype by keywords. 'overrides' wins over everything: 'courses' by subject id, 'experiments' by 'subject/topic'. 'genericKeywords' sends a lab to the general format on purpose (it is then listed in docs/LAB_ARCHETYPE_GAPS.md).",
